+/*
+ * Register offsets for Exynos7880 CMU_CCORE (0x10680000)
+ *
+ * CMU_CCORE is the Exynos7880 counterpart of the CMU_MIF above: BUS_PLL,
+ * MEDIA_PLL and every CMU_* output (mux 0x264-0x2cc, divider 0x460-0x4cc,
+ * gate 0x860-0x8cc) use the same offsets and bit fields. It differs in the
+ * PLL and BUSD mux registers and the HSI2C/ADC_IF gates, and has no MEM_PLL.
+ * The clocks keep the CMU_MIF names and IDs, so the CMUs they feed (FSYS,
+ * G3D, PERI, ...) are shared with Exynos7870.
